sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant Server
    participant SecureAgg as SecureAggregator
    participant ClientA as Client A
    participant ClientB as Client B
    participant DB as Global Model

    Admin->>Server: POST /api/train (Config)
    activate Server
    
    Server->>DB: Get Current State
    DB-->>Server: Model Parameters
    
    par Distribute Model
        Server->>ClientA: Update Model State
        and
        Server->>ClientB: Update Model State
    end
    
    par Local Training
        ClientA->>ClientA: Train LoRA (RAG)
        and
        ClientB->>ClientB: Train LoRA (RAG)
    end
    
    ClientA->>ClientA: Apply DP Noise
    ClientB->>ClientB: Apply DP Noise
    
    note over ClientA, ClientB: Secure Masking Exchange (Pairwise)
    
    ClientA->>Server: Upload Masked Update
    ClientB->>Server: Upload Masked Update
    
    Server->>SecureAgg: Aggregate(Updates)
    activate SecureAgg
    SecureAgg-->>Server: Aggregated Gradients
    deactivate SecureAgg
    
    Server->>Server: Apply Byzantine Check (Norm Filter)
    Server->>DB: Update Global Weights
    
    Server-->>Admin: Round Complete (Metrics)
    deactivate Server
